# Dynamic element conversion after a write

Verifies converting a dynamically indexed element keeps working after a dynamic
write: the element now holds `3dm`, so the conversion scales it to `300mm`.

>>> source
let sizes: int[] = [10mm, 2cm]
let index = 1
sizes[index] = 3dm
print(sizes[index]->to(mm))

<<< stdout
300mm

<<< stderr
